\"mb-2 text-sm sm:mt-px sm:text-base sm:col-span-4 sm:pr-5\">\r\n          Price        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl sm:col-span-8\">\r\n          DKK 180,-\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n      </div>\r\n    \r\n    <!-- Event location -->\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"w-full border-b border-black\"></div>\r\n\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n\n\n\r\n<section  class='block-video alignwide'>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"\">\r\n        <figure class=\"relative flex items-center h-full w-full overflow-hidden aspect-video\">\r\n\r\n      \r\n      \r\n              <div class=\"text-white aspect-video\">\r\n          \r\n    <div class=\"relative w-full h-full overflow-hidden bg-black cursor-pointer group embed-player js-embed-player\">\r\n      <!-- Play button -->\r\n      <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10 flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-150 mix-blend-difference embed-player-content group-hover:mix-blend-normal\">\r\n        <span class=\"text-6xl font-black leading-none uppercase lg:text-8xl\">Play</span>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Poster -->\r\n      <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1423\" src=\"https://voxhall.dk/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Skaermbillede-2026-08-06-kl.-09.48.23-1920x1423.png\" class=\"object-cover embed-player-poster w-full h-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://voxhall.dk/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Skaermbillede-2026-08-06-kl.-09.48.23-1920x1423.png 1920w, https://voxhall.dk/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Skaermbillede-2026-08-06-kl.-09.48.23-1024x759.png 1024w, https://voxhall.dk/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Skaermbillede-2026-08-06-kl.-09.48.23-768x569.png 768w, https://voxhall.dk/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Skaermbillede-2026-08-06-kl.-09.48.23-1536x1139.png 1536w, https://voxhall.dk/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Skaermbillede-2026-08-06-kl.-09.48.23-2048x1518.png 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" />\r\n      <!-- Video Poster -->\r\n      \r\n      <!-- Embed iframe -->\r\n      <div class=\"absolute inset-0 embed-player-source js-embed-player-source\">\r\n        <iframe src='' data-src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/5W7VL-1Ojvo?feature=oembed&#038;controls=1&#038;autoplay=1&#038;rel=0&#038;playsinline=1&#038;modestbranding=1&#038;hd=1&#038;autohide=1&#038;portrait=0&#038;byline=0&#038;badge=0&#038;title=0' frameborder=0 allowfullscreen></iframe>      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n      \r\n    </figure>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n</section>\n\n\r\n<section  class='block-share alignfull'>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-6 mx-auto text-center md:gap-8 xl:gap-12\">\r\n      <div class=\"text-5xl font-bold leading-[0.9] uppercase sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl\">Del en<br> oplevelse</div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"w-full max-w-screen-sm\">\r\n        <button\r\n          type=\"button\"\r\n          class=\"min-w-[75%] btn js-share-button\"\r\n          data-title=\"VoxHall\"\r\n          data-desc=\"Yndling\"\r\n          data-url=\"https://voxhall.dk/koncerter/yndling/\"\r\n          data-email=\"mailto:?subject=VoxHall: Yndling&#038;body=Link%3A%0Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fvoxhall.dk%2Fkoncerter%2Fyndling%2F\"\r\n        >\r\n          <span class=\"hidden xs:block\">Invite your friends</span>\r\n          <span class=\"xs:hidden\">Invite</span>\r\n        </button>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Yndling skaber stemningsfuld dream pop, hvor svævende guitarer, atmosfæriske synthesizere og intime vokaler smelter sammen i et lydunivers med tråde til både shoegaze og triphop. Inspireret af navne som Cocteau Twins, Beach House og Portishead balancerer hendes musik mellem det drømmende og det dybt personlige med en filmisk nerve.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Med debuten markerede Yndling sig hurtigt som et af de mest spændende nye navne på den europæiske dream pop-scene, og opfølgeren <em>Time Time Time (I&#8217;m in the Palm of Your Hand)</em> cementerede hendes internationale gennembrud med opbakning fra blandt andre BBC 6 Music og flere af Spotifys toneangivende playlister.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">I Aarhus kan publikum nu opleve Yndlings dragende liveunivers, hvor de mange lag fra indspilningerne foldes ud i hypnotiske rytmer, glitrende teksturer og nærværende melodier. Koncerten på VoxHall er en oplagt mulighed for at opleve en kunstner, der er ved at etablere sig som en af de stærkeste nye stemmer inden for moderne dream pop.</p>\n\n\n\r\n  <section  class='block-link-list grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-12 gap-y-3 sm:gap-x-5 leading-tight aligncenter'>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"border-t border-black sm:col-span-12\"></div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"text-sm sm:text-base sm:col-span-4 sm:pr-5 sm:mt-px\">\r\n      Links    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"space-y-2 sm:col-span-8\">\r\n      <div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/yndling.music\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" class=\"flex flex-nowrap justify-between items-center group relative text-base sm:text-xl lg:text-2xl transition-opacity \">\r\n\t\t\t\t\tYndling Facebook \r\n\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t</div><div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/din.yndling/?hl=da\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" class=\"flex flex-nowrap justify-between items-center group relative text-base sm:text-xl lg:text-2xl transition-opacity \">\r\n\t\t\t\t\tYndling Instagram \r\n\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t</div>    </div>\r\n\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n\n\n\r\n\r\n  <section  class='block-faq relative has-background bg-[#DCDCDC] pt-16 lg:pt-32 alignfull aligncenter'>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex justify-center site-padding-x\">\r\n      <div class=\"w-full max-w-screen-md bg-white py-4 sm:py-6 site-padding-x\">\r\n\r\n                  <div class=\"block-faq-accordion accordion js-accordion\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"accordion-summary\">\r\n              <div class=\"flex flex-col accordion-summary__heading\">\r\n                \r\n                Din billet              </div>\r\n\r\n                              <div class=\"accordion-summary__toggle\">\r\n                  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 45 41\">\r\n                    <path fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"m43.36 17.854-21.12 21.12-21.12-21.12m21.12 21.119V.674\"/>\r\n                  </svg>\r\n                </div>\r\n                          </div>\r\n\r\n                          <div class=\"accordion-content\">\r\n                <p class=\"faq-modalanswer\">Din billet er vedhæftet som pdf i din ordrebekræftelse fra Billetten. Vi anbefaler at du medbringer din billet på telefonen og sparer papiret. Vi kan dog scanne din billet både printet og på din smartphone. Vælger du at vise din billet på smartphone må du gerne sørge for, at lysstyrken er skruet op. Bemærk vi kan ikke scanne på en skærm, der er smadret.</p>\n              </div>\r\n            \r\n          </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"block-faq-accordion accordion js-accordion\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"accordion-summary\">\r\n              <div class=\"flex flex-col accordion-summary__heading\">\r\n                \r\n                Find vej              </div>\r\n\r\n                              <div class=\"accordion-summary__toggle\">\r\n                  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 45 41\">\r\n                    <path fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"m43.36 17.854-21.12 21.12-21.12-21.12m21.12 21.119V.674\"/>\r\n                  </svg>\r\n                </div>\r\n                          </div>\r\n\r\n                          <div class=\"accordion-content\">\r\n                <p>Der er ikke parkering ved VoxHall. Vi anbefaler at du bruger offentlig transport, der holder flere busser lige ved siden af VoxHall og Aarhus Banegård er kun 10 minutters gang fra VoxHall.</p>\n<p>Adressen er:</p>\n<p>VoxHall<br />\nVester Allé 15<br />\n8000 Aarhus C</p>\n              </div>\r\n            \r\n          </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"block-faq-accordion accordion js-accordion\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"accordion-summary\">\r\n              <div class=\"flex flex-col accordion-summary__heading\">\r\n                \r\n                Garderobe              </div>\r\n\r\n                              <div class=\"accordion-summary__toggle\">\r\n                  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 45 41\">\r\n                    <path fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"m43.36 17.854-21.12 21.12-21.12-21.12m21.12 21.119V.674\"/>\r\n                  </svg>\r\n                </div>\r\n                          </div>\r\n\r\n                          <div class=\"accordion-content\">\r\n                <p>På VoxHall har vi en garderobe, hvor du trygt kan aflevere din jakke og taske, hvis du har behov for det.</p>\n<p>Garderobeprisen er 20 DKK per jakke og per taske.</p>\n              </div>\r\n            \r\n          </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"block-faq-accordion accordion js-accordion\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"accordion-summary\">\r\n              <div class=\"flex flex-col accordion-summary__heading\">\r\n                \r\n                Vis hensyn              </div>\r\n\r\n                              <div class=\"accordion-summary__toggle\">\r\n                  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 45 41\">\r\n                    <path fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"m43.36 17.854-21.12 21.12-21.12-21.12m21.12 21.119V.674\"/>\r\n                  </svg>\r\n                </div>\r\n                          </div>\r\n\r\n                          <div class=\"accordion-content\">\r\n                <p>At gå til koncert hos VoxHall er en fælles oplevelse. Det er derfor vigtigt at udvise hensyn over for hinanden, så alle får en god oplevelse &#8211; og det gælder både publikum, vores frivillige og selvfølgelig også orkestrene.</p>\n<p>Vi opfordrer derfor bl.a. alle til at tage de vigtige snakke efter koncerten og nyde musikken med respekt for koncertens øvrige publikummer mens koncerten foregår.</p>\n              </div>\r\n            \r\n          </div>\r\n        \r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n          <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col overflow-hidden block-faq-marquee\">\r\n                  <div class=\"flex nowrap js-faq-marquee block-faq-marquee-text \">\r\n            Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions           </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"flex nowrap js-faq-marquee block-faq-marquee-text justify-end js-faq-marquee-even\">\r\n            Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions           </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"flex nowrap js-faq-marquee block-faq-marquee-text \">\r\n            Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions           </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"flex nowrap js-faq-marquee block-faq-marquee-text justify-end js-faq-marquee-even\">\r\n            Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions           </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"flex nowrap js-faq-marquee block-faq-marquee-text \">\r\n            Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions           </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"flex nowrap js-faq-marquee block-faq-marquee-text justify-end js-faq-marquee-even\">\r\n            Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions           </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"flex nowrap js-faq-marquee block-faq-marquee-text \">\r\n            Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions           </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"flex nowrap js-faq-marquee block-faq-marquee-text justify-end js-faq-marquee-even\">\r\n            Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions           </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"flex nowrap js-faq-marquee block-faq-marquee-text \">\r\n            Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions           </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"flex nowrap js-faq-marquee block-faq-marquee-text justify-end js-faq-marquee-even\">\r\n            Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions           </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"flex nowrap js-faq-marquee block-faq-marquee-text \">\r\n            Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions           </div>\r\n              </div>\r\n    \r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n",
