entColor\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <!-- Hero scroll observer -->\r\n  <div event-hero-scroll-observer class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-px h-px opacity-0\"></div>\r\n\r\n</header>\n\n\n\r\n\r\n  <section  class='block-lead-paragraph alignfull'>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"max-w-screen-xl mx-auto text-3xl leading-tighter md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl 3xl:max-w-full\">\r\n      Oplev den næste generation af dansk musik sammen med GAUSS    </div>\r\n\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n\n\n\r\n  <section  class='block-event-information aligncenter'>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Event date -->\r\n          <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 pt-3 pb-8 leading-tight border-t border-black sm:pb-12 sm:grid-cols-12 sm:gap-x-5\">\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"mb-2 text-sm sm:mt-px sm:text-base sm:col-span-4 sm:pr-5\">\r\n          Date        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1 text-xl sm:text-2xl sm:space-y-2 sm:col-span-8\">\r\n          <time\r\n            itemprop=\"startDate\"\r\n            datetime=\"2026-09-04 20:00:00\"\r\n            content=\"2026-09-04 20:00:00\"\r\n          >\r\n            Fredag 4. september 2026           </time>\r\n\r\n                  </div>\r\n\r\n      </div>\r\n    \r\n    <!-- Event time -->\r\n          <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 pt-3 pb-8 leading-tight border-t border-black sm:pb-12 sm:grid-cols-12 sm:gap-x-5\">\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"mb-2 text-sm sm:mt-px sm:text-base sm:col-span-4 sm:pr-5\">\r\n          Time        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1 text-xl sm:text-2xl sm:space-y-2 sm:col-span-8\">\r\n                      <div\r\n              itemprop=\"doorTime\"\r\n              content=\"19.00\"\r\n            >\r\n              19.00 (Doors open)\r\n            </div>\r\n          \r\n          <div>\r\n            20.00 (Concert start)\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n      </div>\r\n    \r\n    <!-- Event price -->\r\n    \r\n    <!-- Event location -->\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"w-full border-b border-black\"></div>\r\n\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n\n\n\r\n<section  class='block-video alignwide'>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"\">\r\n        <figure class=\"relative flex items-center h-full w-full overflow-hidden aspect-video\">\r\n\r\n      \r\n      \r\n              <div class=\"text-white aspect-video\">\r\n          \r\n    <div class=\"relative w-full h-full overflow-hidden bg-black cursor-pointer group embed-player js-embed-player\">\r\n      <!-- Play button -->\r\n      <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10 flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-150 mix-blend-difference embed-player-content group-hover:mix-blend-normal\">\r\n        <span class=\"text-6xl font-black leading-none uppercase lg:text-8xl\">Play</span>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Poster -->\r\n      <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1135\" src=\"https://voxhall.dk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Skaermbillede-2026-06-30-kl.-12.23.25-1920x1135.png\" class=\"object-cover embed-player-poster w-full h-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://voxhall.dk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Skaermbillede-2026-06-30-kl.-12.23.25-1920x1135.png 1920w, https://voxhall.dk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Skaermbillede-2026-06-30-kl.-12.23.25-1024x605.png 1024w, https://voxhall.dk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Skaermbillede-2026-06-30-kl.-12.23.25-768x454.png 768w, https://voxhall.dk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Skaermbillede-2026-06-30-kl.-12.23.25-1536x908.png 1536w, https://voxhall.dk/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Skaermbillede-2026-06-30-kl.-12.23.25-2048x1210.png 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" />\r\n      <!-- Video Poster -->\r\n      \r\n      <!-- Embed iframe -->\r\n      <div class=\"absolute inset-0 embed-player-source js-embed-player-source\">\r\n        <iframe src='' data-src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/u303Z8eC-88?feature=oembed&#038;controls=1&#038;autoplay=1&#038;rel=0&#038;playsinline=1&#038;modestbranding=1&#038;hd=1&#038;autohide=1&#038;portrait=0&#038;byline=0&#038;badge=0&#038;title=0' frameborder=0 allowfullscreen></iframe>      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n      \r\n    </figure>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n</section>\n\n\r\n<section  class='block-share alignfull'>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-6 mx-auto text-center md:gap-8 xl:gap-12\">\r\n      <div class=\"text-5xl font-bold leading-[0.9] uppercase sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl\">Del en<br> oplevelse</div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"w-full max-w-screen-sm\">\r\n        <button\r\n          type=\"button\"\r\n          class=\"min-w-[75%] btn js-share-button\"\r\n          data-title=\"VoxHall\"\r\n          data-desc=\"GAUSS præs. Oskar Witt, Midlertidigt Fore!gt &amp; Bagudd\"\r\n          data-url=\"https://voxhall.dk/koncerter/gauss-praes-oskar-witt-midlertidigt-foregt-bagudd/\"\r\n          data-email=\"mailto:?subject=VoxHall: GAUSS%20pr%C3%A6s.%20Oskar%20Witt%2C%20Midlertidigt%20Fore%21gt%20%26amp%3B%20Bagudd&#038;body=Link%3A%0Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fvoxhall.dk%2Fkoncerter%2Fgauss-praes-oskar-witt-midlertidigt-foregt-bagudd%2F\"\r\n        >\r\n          <span class=\"hidden xs:block\">Invite your friends</span>\r\n          <span class=\"xs:hidden\">Invite</span>\r\n        </button>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Tre af den danske undergrunds mest spændende nye navne indtager Aarhus til en aften med personlige fortællinger, stærke liveoptrædener og musik, der bevæger sig mellem hiphop, alternativ pop og elektroniske eksperimenter. Koncerten præsenteres af GAUSS &#8211; VoxHalls talentforløb for unge koncertarrangører &#8211; og entré er gratis med billet.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Oskar Witt</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Oskar Witt har på kort tid etableret sig som en af de mest markante nye stemmer på den danske rapscene. Med rødder i poetry slam og inspiration fra både klassisk hiphop og dansk lyrik skaber han et kompromisløst univers, hvor identitet, kærlighed og eksistentielle spørgsmål møder tunge beats og skarpe tekster. Live er han kendt for sin intense energi og stærke publikumskontakt, som har gjort ham til et navn, man bør opleve på scenen.<br></p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Midlertidigt Forev!gt</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1373\" src=\"https://voxhall.dk/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Midlertidigt-Foregt-2-1920x1373.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-31254\" srcset=\"https://voxhall.dk/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Midlertidigt-Foregt-2-1920x1373.jpg 1920w, https://voxhall.dk/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Midlertidigt-Foregt-2-1024x732.jpg 1024w, https://voxhall.dk/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Midlertidigt-Foregt-2-768x549.jpg 768w, https://voxhall.dk/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Midlertidigt-Foregt-2-1536x1098.jpg 1536w, https://voxhall.dk/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Midlertidigt-Foregt-2.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Midlertidigt Forev!gt bevæger sig ubesværet mellem alternativ hiphop, melodiske produktioner og følsom sangskrivning. Musikken kredser om relationer, tvivl og de øjeblikke, hvor livet ændrer retning, leveret med et moderne lydunivers og en ærlig nerve. Resultatet er både eftertænksomt, nærværende og fængende &#8211; og peger på et af de mest interessante nye projekter på i det danske musiklandskab.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Bagudd</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1917\" src=\"https://voxhall.dk/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Bagudd-2-1920x1917.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-31255\" srcset=\"https://voxhall.dk/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Bagudd-2-1920x1917.jpg 1920w, https://voxhall.dk/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Bagudd-2-1024x1022.jpg 1024w, https://voxhall.dk/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Bagudd-2-384x384.jpg 384w, https://voxhall.dk/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Bagudd-2-768x767.jpg 768w, https://voxhall.dk/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Bagudd-2-1536x1534.jpg 1536w, https://voxhall.dk/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Bagudd-2.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Bagudd forener dansksproget hiphop med personlige fortællinger, skæve observationer og melodiske produktioner. Hans musik balancerer mellem det selvironiske og det sårbare, hvor hverdagsøjeblikke bliver til relaterbare fortællinger med kant og varme. Med en afslappet, men nærværende sceneoptræden har Bagudd hurtigt gjort sig bemærket som et navn med både stærke sange og et tydeligt kunstnerisk udtryk.</p>\n\n\n\r\n  <section  class='block-link-list grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-12 gap-y-3 sm:gap-x-5 leading-tight aligncenter'>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"border-t border-black sm:col-span-12\"></div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"text-sm sm:text-base sm:col-span-4 sm:pr-5 sm:mt-px\">\r\n      Links    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"space-y-2 sm:col-span-8\">\r\n      <div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/oskar_witt_/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" class=\"flex flex-nowrap justify-between items-center group relative text-base sm:text-xl lg:text-2xl transition-opacity \">\r\n\t\t\t\t\tOskar Witt Instagram \r\n\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t</div><div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/midlertidigtforevigt/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" class=\"flex flex-nowrap justify-between items-center group relative text-base sm:text-xl lg:text-2xl transition-opacity \">\r\n\t\t\t\t\tMidlertidigtforevigt Instagram \r\n\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t</div><div>\r\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/bagudd2/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" class=\"flex flex-nowrap justify-between items-center group relative text-base sm:text-xl lg:text-2xl transition-opacity \">\r\n\t\t\t\t\tBagudd Instagram \r\n\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t</div>    </div>\r\n\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n\n\n\r\n\r\n  <section  class='block-faq relative has-background bg-[#DCDCDC] pt-16 lg:pt-32 alignfull aligncenter'>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex justify-center site-padding-x\">\r\n      <div class=\"w-full max-w-screen-md bg-white py-4 sm:py-6 site-padding-x\">\r\n\r\n                  <div class=\"block-faq-accordion accordion js-accordion\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"accordion-summary\">\r\n              <div class=\"flex flex-col accordion-summary__heading\">\r\n                \r\n                Din billet              </div>\r\n\r\n                              <div class=\"accordion-summary__toggle\">\r\n                  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 45 41\">\r\n                    <path fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"m43.36 17.854-21.12 21.12-21.12-21.12m21.12 21.119V.674\"/>\r\n                  </svg>\r\n                </div>\r\n                          </div>\r\n\r\n                          <div class=\"accordion-content\">\r\n                <p class=\"faq-modalanswer\">Din billet er vedhæftet som pdf i din ordrebekræftelse fra Billetten. Vi anbefaler at du medbringer din billet på telefonen og sparer papiret. Vi kan dog scanne din billet både printet og på din smartphone. Vælger du at vise din billet på smartphone må du gerne sørge for, at lysstyrken er skruet op. Bemærk vi kan ikke scanne på en skærm, der er smadret.</p>\n              </div>\r\n            \r\n          </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"block-faq-accordion accordion js-accordion\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"accordion-summary\">\r\n              <div class=\"flex flex-col accordion-summary__heading\">\r\n                \r\n                Find vej              </div>\r\n\r\n                              <div class=\"accordion-summary__toggle\">\r\n                  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 45 41\">\r\n                    <path fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"m43.36 17.854-21.12 21.12-21.12-21.12m21.12 21.119V.674\"/>\r\n                  </svg>\r\n                </div>\r\n                          </div>\r\n\r\n                          <div class=\"accordion-content\">\r\n                <p>Der er ikke parkering ved VoxHall. Vi anbefaler at du bruger offentlig transport, der holder flere busser lige ved siden af VoxHall og Aarhus Banegård er kun 10 minutters gang fra VoxHall.</p>\n<p>Adressen er:</p>\n<p>VoxHall<br />\nVester Allé 15<br />\n8000 Aarhus C</p>\n              </div>\r\n            \r\n          </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"block-faq-accordion accordion js-accordion\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"accordion-summary\">\r\n              <div class=\"flex flex-col accordion-summary__heading\">\r\n                \r\n                Garderobe              </div>\r\n\r\n                              <div class=\"accordion-summary__toggle\">\r\n                  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 45 41\">\r\n                    <path fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"m43.36 17.854-21.12 21.12-21.12-21.12m21.12 21.119V.674\"/>\r\n                  </svg>\r\n                </div>\r\n                          </div>\r\n\r\n                          <div class=\"accordion-content\">\r\n                <p>På VoxHall har vi en garderobe, hvor du trygt kan aflevere din jakke og taske, hvis du har behov for det.</p>\n<p>Garderobeprisen er 20 DKK per jakke og per taske.</p>\n              </div>\r\n            \r\n          </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"block-faq-accordion accordion js-accordion\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"accordion-summary\">\r\n              <div class=\"flex flex-col accordion-summary__heading\">\r\n                \r\n                Vis hensyn              </div>\r\n\r\n                              <div class=\"accordion-summary__toggle\">\r\n                  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 45 41\">\r\n                    <path fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"m43.36 17.854-21.12 21.12-21.12-21.12m21.12 21.119V.674\"/>\r\n                  </svg>\r\n                </div>\r\n                          </div>\r\n\r\n                          <div class=\"accordion-content\">\r\n                <p>At gå til koncert hos VoxHall er en fælles oplevelse. Det er derfor vigtigt at udvise hensyn over for hinanden, så alle får en god oplevelse &#8211; og det gælder både publikum, vores frivillige og selvfølgelig også orkestrene.</p>\n<p>Vi opfordrer derfor bl.a. alle til at tage de vigtige snakke efter koncerten og nyde musikken med respekt for koncertens øvrige publikummer mens koncerten foregår.</p>\n              </div>\r\n            \r\n          </div>\r\n        \r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n          <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col overflow-hidden block-faq-marquee\">\r\n                  <div class=\"flex nowrap js-faq-marquee block-faq-marquee-text \">\r\n            Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions           </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"flex nowrap js-faq-marquee block-faq-marquee-text justify-end js-faq-marquee-even\">\r\n            Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions           </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"flex nowrap js-faq-marquee block-faq-marquee-text \">\r\n            Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions Frequently asked questions           </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"flex nowrap js-faq-marquee block-faq-marquee-text justify-end js-faq-marquee-even\">\r\n      